  combinedLines: "PH\xEDa sau c\xF3 H\xECnh b\xF3ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE0n \xF4ng
    \u0111ang ch\u0103m ch\xFA nH\xECn c\u1EADu b\xE9 t\u1EEB \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\u1EBFn
    cu\u1ED1i, trong th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi hoan t\xE0n nh\u1EEFng x\xE1c ch\u1EBFt ch\u1EA5t
    th\xE0nh \u0111\xF3ng kh\xF4ng ai ng\xF3 ng\xE0n, trong m\u1EAFt ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    \u0111\xE0n \xF4ng s\u1EF1 hi\u1EC7n di\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a c\xF4 b\xE9 nh\u01B0
    m\u1ED9t tia \u1EA5m nh\u1ECF b\xE9 len l\u1ED7i gi\u1EEFa m\u1ED9t th\u1EDBi
    gi\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EABm m\xE1u.|Trong v\xF4 th\u1EE9c ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE0n
    \xF4ng \u0111\xE3 ti\u1EBFn l\u1EA1i s\xE1t c\xF4 b\xE9."
